Root cause:
The HDMI interface was not receiving power during the early stages of boot due to the VDDIO_AO18 regulator not being marked as always-on, which resulted in the HDMI functionality being unavailable until the system fully booted. The patch ensures that the regulator is always powered and explicitly sets the hdmi-supply for the hdmi_tx node, fixing the issue.
